url: "https://bart-turczynski.gitlab.io/raddr/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - IP address
  - IPv4
  - IPv6
  - IP parser
  - inet_pton
  - inet_aton
  - WHATWG URL
  - CIDR
  - IANA
  - special-purpose address registry
  - NAT64
  - Teredo
  - 6to4
  - R
